# Rails puts uploaded files in <app>/storage. Written as core/*/storage rather
# than **/storage, because **/storage also matched core/storage, which is the
# Storage service itself: the whole service silently vanished from the build
# context and the image failed with "/core/storage: not found".
core/*/storage
